ed on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:10:39-07:00","id":945557,"title":"","content":"May it is because I've heard that song while reading the book- but for some reason, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ytMqO-WQpQ4\" target=\"_blank\">Something Wild</a> just feels very fit for a promethean's Pilgrim, symbolizing the desperate hope which is featured through the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:31:08-07:00","id":945570,"title":"","content":"Given how often they deal with themes of disenchantment and alienation, I typically use Pink Floyd and The Who as part of my soundtracks. I'v also mentioned it before on the forums, but Postmodern Jukebox is has some great songs for Promethean, since they take modern songs and cover them in different styles. It creates a feeling of alien familiarity that is perfect for The Created.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:52:02-07:00","id":945583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/945435-songs-of-created?p=945556#post945556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The band Steam-Powered Giraffe has a number of songs that could fit Promethean, considering their personae are sentient steam-powered robots.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're the first person I've ever seen mention Steam-Powered Giraffe! They're from my home town (my friend went to high school with two of them) and I think they're super underloved. I've seen <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQWY-JOhF2I\" target=\"_blank\">Automatonic Electronic Harmonics</a> as my primary Promethean anthem for years now, especially this bit with The Spine:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">They say<br /> <br /> Oh, oh it's so down, but baby it's sound<br /> makes your worries cease to pound</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And oh, maybe it's alright, 'cause baby it fights<br /> for some time just to be held tight</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And oh, maybe it's not wrong, 'cause it sings a lovely song<br /> one that drifts on for so long</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And oh, baby let's not lie, it's eyes are alive<br /> and pointed up shining light to the sky</span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Or if we want to be less serious Oingo Boingo's <i>Weird Science </i>is an essential Created tune about a goofy demiurge breaking all the rules in order to carry out the generative act; before 2e was announced, I'd considered doing a 2e update with all the section headers being lyrics from it.</span></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T01:02:47-07:00","id":946008,"title":"","content":"Song <b>Nemo</b> fron Nightwish is great Promethan tune. Add to it clips from <b>Full Metal Alchemist </b>- that is official inspiration for <b>PtC</b> now - and we get a massive inspiration boost. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pwW4e1fl788\" data-code=\"pwW4e1fl788\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pwW4e1fl788/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Lyrics ( bold by me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ): <div align=\"center\"><b>&quot;Nemo&quot;</b></div> <div align=\"center\">This is me for forever<br /> <b>One of the lost ones<br /> The one without a name<br /> Without an honest heart as compass</b><br /> This is me for forever<br /> One without a name<br /> These lines the last endeavor<br /> <b>To find the missing lifeline</b><br /> <br /> Oh how I wish<br /> <b>For soothing rain<br /> All I wish is to dream again<br /> My loving heart<br /> Lost in the dark<br /> For hope I'd give my everything</b><br /> <br /> My flower, withered between<br /> The pages 2 and 3<br /> The once and forever bloom gone with my sins<br /> Walk the dark path<br /> <b>Sleep with angels<br /> Call the past for help<br /> Touch me with your love<br /> And reveal to me my true name</b><br /> (...)</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-08-2016, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T04:34:23-07:00","id":948513,"title":"","content":"Throughout my reading of Promethean 2e, I've been listening to Transmutations by Disparition. It's good for ambiance, so I'd probably use it somewhere if I were to run a game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 